 "seasonCaption": "Each line is one sign’s English Wikipedia article on a typical day of the year, 2016 to 2025, against that sign’s own typical day. The bright stretch is the sign’s season. The lift shows in 118 of 120 sign-years. This measures curiosity, not demand for the coins.",
